-- Diet
on conflict (pokedex_id, diet_id) do nothing;

-- Habitat
on conflict (pokedex_id, habitat_id) do nothing;

-- Proficiencies (Arceus/Cosmog/Cosmoem/Lunala deliberately excluded -- their source text is prose
-- ("can know any move") not a real proficiency list, left with none rather than force-fit)
on conflict (pokedex_id, proficiency_id) do nothing;
